  "published": "2026-09-08T22:21:57.197Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 🆕 Additions\n- Added `maxBufferedOutputBytes` to the `CliRun` string-args buffered path to enable capping buffered output size in memory.\n\n### ⚙️ Modifications\n- `OutputTruncationMiddleware` now reads the truncation cap from exit configuration instead of a string-keyed handoff, and `MaxSize` is now `MaxBytes`.\n- Reworked retry middleware around the classifier\n- Documented the redirect-flag OR collapse in `FromProcessStartInfo`.\n\n### 🗑️ Removals\n- Removed `ProcessConfigurationFactory`. Use init construction or the builder.\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed a race in `ExternalProcess` where the start gate and wrapper swap could interleave. Both are now serialized under a private lock.\n- Fixed `ProcessWrapper` lifecycle issues: the cancellation reason is reported when caught, `ForcefulExit` guards against self-invocation, and event invocation is null-conditional.\n- Fixed flaky resource policy application on fast-exiting processes.\n- Fixed validator registration extensions to use `Add` instead of `TryAdd` so re-registration works.\n- Fixed `CachingFilePathResolver` cache keys to respect per-OS path casing rules.\n- Fixed a Unix `FilePathResolver` filename match issue.\n- Fixed `PathEnvironmentVariable` to expand `~` and `C:\\Users` paths in a single pass.\n- The Unix control adapter now throws `PlatformNotSupportedException` for ``UserCredential``",
